OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPlenty of sunshine on offer
OL,6,Ftoday in-between patchy cloud with a
OL,7,Frisk of showers most frequent in the
OL,8,Fnorthwest to start, these becoming
OL,9,Fmore widespread by the afternoon.
OL,10,FFeeling noticeably chillier in a
OL,11,Fnorthwesterly breeze.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA chillier night to come,
OL,14,Fespecially under clearer skies with
OL,15,Flight northerly winds. More in the way
OL,16,Fof cloud with a risk of showers along
OL,17,Fthe west coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
