OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA bright start to Saturday,
OL,6,Fwith long sunny spells but turning
OL,7,Fcloudier throughout the afternoon.
OL,8,FTemperatures remaining around average
OL,9,Ffor the time of year.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FAgain,
OL,12,Fplenty of sunshine on offer to start
OL,13,Fon Sunday, before turning cloudier
OL,14,Fwith some welcome rain to southernmost
OL,15,Fareas through Monday into Tuesday.
